      "writtenOn": "2025-09-09T17:40:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  This function also puts the event on the FIFO. \n\nThis is not necessary since the ISH is responsible for sending the on-body/off-body event to the host. The kernel is not picking up any sensor from the EC.\n\n\u003e It\u0027s possible we can decouple this further so we can avoid putting it on the motionsense fifo, but I haven\u0027t look into that yet. Would you like me to?\n\nThat would make sense since the activity sensor relies only on MEMS sensor, that are owned by the ISH.",
